{"applicability_conditions":"适用于由铁素体（α）和奥氏体（γ）两相组成的双相材料；σ(ε) 描述塑性变形过程中流变应力的演化。","identity":{"block_id":"b0074","equation_id":"equation_004","equation_number":"6","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\sigma (\\varepsilon) = 0. 7 5 7 \\sigma_ {\\alpha} (\\varepsilon) + 0. 2 4 3 \\sigma_ {\\gamma} (\\varepsilon)\\tag{6}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.msea.2026.149792"},"latex":"\\sigma (\\varepsilon) = 0.757 \\sigma_{\\alpha} (\\varepsilon) + 0.243 \\sigma_{\\gamma} (\\varepsilon)","purpose":"将总应变硬化项 σ(ε) 表示为铁素体和奥氏体两相各自的应变硬化项按质量分数加权的组合。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"应变硬化项，表征塑性变形过程中流变应力的演化","symbol":"\\sigma (\\varepsilon)","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"铁素体（α）的质量分数（75.7%）","symbol":"0.757","unit":null,"value":"75.7 %"},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"铁素体（α）相在塑性变形过程中的应变硬化项","symbol":"\\sigma_{\\alpha} (\\varepsilon)","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"奥氏体（γ）的质量分数（24.3%）","symbol":"0.243","unit":null,"value":"24.3 %"},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"奥氏体（γ）相在塑性变形过程中的应变硬化项","symbol":"\\sigma_{\\gamma} (\\varepsilon)","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["总流变应力由 σ_tot = σ_0 + σ(ε) 给出（式5），其中 σ_0 为与变形无关的强化贡献（屈服应力）"]}